@startuml

[*] : Initial state; Shut Down

: Shut Down --> Running : Restart

Running --> Configuration Mode : Changes or power-saving settings required

Configuration Mode --> Running : Configuration is completed

Running --> Running [Data Collection] : Clock trigger

Running --> Running [Summary Preparation] : Request for weather summary

Running --> Running [Status Check] : Request for status check

Running, Configuration Mode, Controlled Mode --> Running : Activity completion

Running --> Shut Down : Shutdown command

Shut Down --> [*] : Termination

@enduml
